# kfn8 monorepo ignore rules. This is the only ignore file in the repository; do not add nested ones.
#
# Principle: generated, per-user and secret material is ignored; authored material is versioned even when it is
# large. Versioned on purpose: Swift/Python sources, project.yml, Package.swift and Package.resolved, shared Xcode
# schemes, the legacy iOS project, USDZ/GLB/textures under assets*/, specification PNGs, reports/ and
# reports/evidence/ (device screenshots and evidence JSON), fonts and their licences, backend contracts/, alembic/
# migrations, assets-source/ (CC0 inputs), assets-conformed/ (approved outputs), ledger/ (approval evidence), ops/
# (deploy spec and runbook), requirements.txt, .python-version, uv/poetry/pip lockfiles.
#
# Unanchored patterns apply at any depth; patterns starting with / are relative to this file.

### macOS, editors, agents
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.log
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

### AVP client (_Kfn8-frontend-avp/_Kfn8-frontend-avp-src)
# Generated by xcodegen from project.yml via ./setup.sh; the spec is the source of truth.
/_Kfn8-frontend-avp/_Kfn8-frontend-avp-src/Kfn8.xcodeproj/
# Xcode and SwiftPM build products and per-user state (Package.resolved and shared schemes stay versioned).
DerivedData/
build/
.build/
.swiftpm/xcode/package.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
.swiftpm/configuration/
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout
*.xcarchive/
*.xcresult/
*.dSYM/
*.dSYM.zip
*.ipa
*.app/
*.hmap
*.ncb
# Simulator/device capture scratch; deliberate evidence is copied into _Kfn8-frontend-avp/reports/evidence/ instead.
/_Kfn8-frontend-avp/_Kfn8-frontend-avp-src/**/*.png.tmp

