*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.db-journal
/_Kfn8-frontend-avp/_Kfn8-backend-fastapi/.minio/
/_Kfn8-frontend-avp/_Kfn8-backend-fastapi/.storage/
/_Kfn8-frontend-avp/_Kfn8-backend-fastapi/ingest-work/

### Secrets, credentials and signing (safe examples stay versioned)
